{"term": {"label": "禮", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "1A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/liang-hui-wang-i", "title": "梁惠王上", "description": "孟子見梁惠王。王曰：「叟不遠千里而來，亦將有以利吾國乎？」\n孟子對曰：「王何必曰利？亦有仁義而已矣。王曰『何以利吾國』？大夫曰『何以利吾家』？士庶人曰『何以利吾身』？上下交征利而國危矣。萬乘之國弒其君者，必千乘之家；千乘之國弒其君者，必百乘之家。萬取千焉，千取百焉，不為不多矣。苟為後義而先利，不奪不饜。未有仁而遺其親者", "occurrences": 1, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "利", "id": "利"}, {"form": "君", "id": "君"}, {"form": "孝", "id": "孝"}, {"form": "後", "id": "後"}, {"form": "悌", "id": "悌"}, {"form": "為", "id": "爲"}, {"form": "禮", "id": "禮"}, {"form": "義", "id": "義"}], "edges": [{"weight": 4.33510971488613, "source": "悌", "target": "孝"}, {"weight": 3.082346746390762, "source": "悌", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 1.339377441332139, "source": "君", "target": "後"}, {"weight": 1.6960523852708713, "source": "君", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 3.082346746390762, "source": "孝", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 1.051695368880358, "source": "利", "target": "後"}, {"weight": 0.3585481883204127, "source": "利", "target": "爲"}, {"weight": 1.4083703128190905, "source": "利", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 0.13540463700620298, "source": "爲", "target": "後"}, {"weight": 0.4920795809449353, "source": "爲", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 0.6462302607721937, "source": "爲", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 2.3891995658308165, "source": "仁", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 1.878373942064826, "source": "義", "target": "後"}, {"weight": 3.4878118544989265, "source": "義", "target": "禮"}]}}